      ## Actions

      ***Abyssal Glaive.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=To Hit [Abyssal Glaive]), reach 10 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d12+4,dicelabel=Damage [Abyssal Glaive]) Slashing damage plus rollable(dice=3d6,dicelabel=Damage [Abyssal Glaive]) Necrotic damage.

      ***Gore (rollable(dice=1d6,label=Recharge 5-6,dicelabel=Recharge [Gore])).*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=To Hit [Gore]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=4d6+4,dicelabel=Damage [Gore]) Piercing damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature and the minotaur moved 10+ feet straight toward it immediately before the hit, the target takes an extra rollable(dice=3d6,dicelabel=Damage [Gore]) Piercing damage and has the ***Prone*** condition.

